    "detailed_description": "\u300aResurrection Island: Love and Victory\u300b is a game developed by \u3055\u3093\u304b\u3063\u3051\u3044 and TJacky, created by the two of them with related art and programming.<br><br>In the game, you will play as a nameless knight who engages in battles with furry girls on a mysterious island, seeking lost memories and a way off the island.<br><br>You will battle against 8 furry girls, proving your abilities through challenges and gaining their recognition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0CG</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=612 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The gameplay presents turn-based bullet-hell battles, where you interact with characters and scenes on the map to unlock 16 animated CGs featuring interactions with the furry girls.<br><br>It also includes a small amount of puzzle-solving elements, with gameplay taking place on pixel-style scenes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=600 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=600 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u300aResurrection Island: Love and Victory\u300b is a game developed by \u3055\u3093\u304b\u3063\u3051\u3044 and TJacky, created by the two of them with related art and programming.<br><br>In the game, you will play as a nameless knight who engages in battles with furry girls on a mysterious island, seeking lost memories and a way off the island.<br><br>You will battle against 8 furry girls, proving your abilities through challenges and gaining their recognition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0CG</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=612 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/d45857753928f7774dea26c34e7be35f.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The gameplay presents turn-based bullet-hell battles, where you interact with characters and scenes on the map to unlock 16 animated CGs featuring interactions with the furry girls.<br><br>It also includes a small amount of puzzle-solving elements, with gameplay taking place on pixel-style scenes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=600 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/0b31587779fee47800e1c42aa4a50bb2.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.poster.avif?t=1730363258\" width=600 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.webm?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578240/extras/29e9db6c7996c938d15ae0a4f56884f7.mp4?t=1730363258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
